# Phase 4 - Advanced Enumeration

## 🧠 BloodHound Collection

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --bloodhound --collection All

## 📝 User Descriptions

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass -M user-desc

## 🔐 LAPS Enumeration

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass -M laps

## 🌐 Network Info

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass -M get-network

## 📜 DACL Analysis

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass -M daclread -o TARGET=Administrator ACTION=read
